# Expected differences between two images that were built from packages (before
# and after a change). Used by compare-rootfs.py.
# Format: a regular expression for the path, two spaces, the reason.
^(lib/apk/db/|var/log/apk\.log$|etc/apk/world$|var/cache/fontconfig/)  apk database, apk log, package list and font caches
^etc/tsx/build-id$  build time stamp
^opt/lva/lib/micro_features_cpp\.abi3\.so$  extension compiled again in each image build
